    dc:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch11-19--grok>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch11-19--grok--discriminating-power> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
